{"3000130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SHIP ON WHEELS", "steam_appid": 3000130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5011810], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship on Wheels</strong> is an <strong>arcade rally-style racing game</strong> focused on speed, skill, and instant fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through intense, carefully designed tracks, accessible to all thanks to simple and intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Multiplayer &amp; Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>multiplayer</strong> and compete against other players in thrilling races!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Classic Race</strong>: Be the first to pass all checkpoints to win the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Blockship Hunt</strong>: Use your GPS to locate all hidden Blockships — the fastest player wins!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Track Editor &amp; Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a powerful <strong>track editor</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own custom tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share them with the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players’ creations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏱️ Time Attack Tournaments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or join <strong>Time Attack tournaments</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you’re the fastest pilot!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship on Wheels</strong> is an <strong>arcade rally-style racing game</strong> focused on speed, skill, and instant fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race through intense, carefully designed tracks, accessible to all thanks to simple and intuitive controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✨ Multiplayer &amp; Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into <strong>multiplayer</strong> and compete against other players in thrilling races!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏁 <strong>Classic Race</strong>: Be the first to pass all checkpoints to win the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧭 <strong>Blockship Hunt</strong>: Use your GPS to locate all hidden Blockships — the fastest player wins!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Track Editor &amp; Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your creativity with a powerful <strong>track editor</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your own custom tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share them with the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge other players’ creations</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⏱️ Time Attack Tournaments</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or join <strong>Time Attack tournaments</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete for the best times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prove you’re the fastest pilot!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ship on Wheels is an arcade rally-style racing game focused on speed, skill, and instant fun.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/48e2968d08f58aadc8bd35583d38f61eee08a097/header.jpg?t=1786971892", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/070ae4dabb775d23dddd4d9fd15d002f937d7d07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786971892", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3000130/070ae4dabb775d23dddd4d9fd15d002f937d7d07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786971892", "webs